peek (1.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream: peek-ng fork of the deprecated phw/peek.
    - Fixes rendering hanging forever on long recordings.
    - Restores MP4 recording.
    - Uses FFmpeg by default on X11 sessions, avoiding the GNOME Shell
      recorder timeouts on GNOME 42 and later.
    - Fixes frame drops in GIF recordings, gifski downscaling, the countdown
      digit being captured, and several crashes and cleanup bugs.
  * Take over packaging from the orphaned Debian package (#1030266).
  * debian/control: Point Homepage and Vcs at the fork, make GStreamer
    plugins Recommends since they are only needed on GNOME Wayland.

 -- Alexey Zaytsev <alexey.zaytsev@gmail.com>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 17:00:00 -0300

peek (1.5.1+git20230114-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * QA upload.
  * Orphan the package. (See #1030266)
  * New upstream git snapshot declaring project deprecation.
  * debian/control: Bump Standards-Version to 4.6.2.

